      "id": "split-button-menu-motion",
      "statement": "Rotate the trailing menu icon inward by 180 degrees when the menu opens and closes, using the standard motion scheme rather than the expressive motion scheme; selection also applies a shape morph.",
      "condition": "When opening or closing the trailing menu button.",
      "basis": "explicit",
      "notes": "",
